# YouTube on VPS/datacenter IPs (Contabo, AWS, etc.)
#
# IMPORTANT: Cookies exported from your HOME PC often FAIL on the VPS because
# YouTube ties sessions to IP addresses. The backend now uses android_vr + PO
# tokens automatically — cookies are optional extra, not required.
#
# === If you still want cookies (optional) ===
#
# 1. Use Firefox (not Chrome) — log in to https://www.youtube.com
# 2. Extension: "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY"
# 3. Export → Current site → save as cookies.txt
# 4. File must contain .youtube.com lines with SID and LOGIN_INFO
#
# === Coolify ===
#
# Upload cookies.txt to container path: /app/cookies.txt
# Do NOT commit cookies.txt to Git.
#
# === PO Token (built into Docker image) ===
#
# The backend Docker image starts bgutil automatically on port 4416.
# Env (optional): BGUTIL_POT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4416
#
# === Verify deployment ===
#
# GET /api/health should show:
#   cookies_configured: true/false
#   cookies_has_login: true (if using cookies)
#   bgutil_pot_url: http://127.0.0.1:4416
